ld; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">选课时间</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">年级</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">选课方式</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">备注</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 67.85pt; text-align: center;"><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">轮</span></p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">预选</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">9月3日</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">9</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">:00～</span></p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">9月4</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">日</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">:</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">0</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">0</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2025</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">推荐+</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">志愿选课</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">选课分两个批次。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">方案内课程已推荐班级，可志愿退改，退改即刻生效；</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">通识教育选修课为志愿选课，规定</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">时段</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">均</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">可选课，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">在</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">选课结束之前可修改</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">所选</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">课程</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.1pt; text-align: center;"><td style="display: none; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">9月</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">日</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">0:00～</span></p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">9月</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">4</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">日1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">:</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">0</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">0</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2024</span></p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2023</span></p></td><td style="display: none; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td><td style="display: none; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 47.2pt; text-align: center;"><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">轮</span></p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">正选</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">9月4日</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">14</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">:</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">0～</span></p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">9</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">月5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">日</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">10</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">:</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">0</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">0</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2025</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">即选即得</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">开放推荐班选课。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学生</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">可</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">依据第</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1轮</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">选课，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">按</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">个人情况进行</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">补</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">选</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，选课限制时间冲突。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 48.55pt; text-align: center;"><td style="display: none; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">9月4日1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">:</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">0～</span></p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">9</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">月5日10:00</span></p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2024</span></p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2023</span></p></td><td style="display: none; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td><td style="display: none; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">1.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">预选阶段</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">为</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">推荐+</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">志愿选课</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">模式，每个学生根据个人学习情况完成对应批次的选课。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">第一批次为方案内课程选课。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">方案内课程采取推荐模式，即已为学生推荐必修课选课结果，课程</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">限定课容量，同一课程存在多个推荐班级的，学生可</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">进行课程班级调整，调整即刻生效。方案内选修课程，学生需要根据方案要求以及个人情况进行选课，方案内课程即选即得。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">第二批次为通识教育选修课选课（根据个人通识教育选修课已获学分进行选课）。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">通识选修课为志愿选课模式，学生可选五个志愿，同一课堂若第一志愿超出课容量，则随机抽签决定中签学生（依次</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">类推</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">），选课限制时间冲突</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">通识教育选修课预选结果</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">将于</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">9月4日1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">时00分</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">公布</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">正选阶段为即选即得</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">模式</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">，覆盖方案内课程与通识教育选修课（一个选课批次）。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">学生可依据第1轮选课结果，按个人情况进行课程调整，选课限制时间冲突。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">正选选即</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">选即得，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">学生</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">可</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">实</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">时</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">查看</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">选课结果。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">二、具体说明及要求</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">1.选课采用推荐选课模式。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">已为学生预置必修课选课结果（不含英语分级课程及大学体育）。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">同一课程</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">有多个推荐教学班的</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">，可</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">在对应教学班中调换，调整即刻生效，课程</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">限定课容量</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。学生需根据培养方案要求和个人情况进行选课，为即选即得模式，限制时间冲突，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">可</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">实</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">时</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">查看个人</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">选课结果</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2.通识课选课及重修选课。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"> 通识教育选修课选课人数不足15人的课程会做停开处理，重修选课计划在第2周进行，请及时关注教务处主页通知。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">3.大学英语</span><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">选课</span><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">按照英语分级教学规定执行，请学生根据个人英语等级，按照文件要求选择对应级别课程。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">4.大学体育选课。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">请依据《西安电子科技大学体育俱乐部学生入会条件》（</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">附件1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">），做好自我评定，挑选级别合适的俱乐部。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">三、其他补充事项</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">请本科生严格按照规定时间和选课要求进行选课，各教学单位密切关注学生选课进度，提醒学生按时选课，确保所有学生知晓此次选课安排；</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">请仔细查阅个人培养方案，不遗漏相关课程。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">未选课的学生不允许参加教学活动，选课学生不按规定参加教学活动的，其成绩一律作零分处理；必修课未选漏选的，在各项排名时按“零分”计算；</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">.请密切关注教务处主页最新通知（</span><span class="docx_11" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">http://jwc.xidian.edu.cn</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">）并于选课结束后及时查看个人课表（部分课程未安排时间地点的，在课程列表右侧展示）；</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">4.选课期间存在疑问的学生请咨询所在学院，具体联系方式</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">见附件2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。选课地址为：http://xk.xidian.edu.cn，账号密码若有遗忘、错误等问题请咨询信息网络技术中心029-88201650。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">附件：</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">1.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">体育俱乐部学生入会条件</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">（单独下载）</span></p><p class="docx-num-0-255" style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 80pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2.各单位选课负责老师联系方式（见下页）</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: right; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: right; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"> 本科生院</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"> </span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: right; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2026年9月</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"> </span></p><p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></article></section><section class="docx"><article><p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"></span><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">附件2</span></p><p style="min-height: 20pt; line-height: 20pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">各单位选课负责老师联系方式</span></p><table class="docx_9" style="width: 99.96%; table-layout: auto; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><colgroup><col style="width: 204.9pt;"><col style="width: 78.9pt;"><col style="width: 142.15pt;"></colgroup><tbody><tr class="firstRow" style="height: 28.35pt; text-align: center;"><td style="border-width: 1pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0pt 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle;"><p style="min-height: 20pt; line-height: 20pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">单位</span></p></td><td style="border-top: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0pt 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle;"><p style="min-height: 20pt; line-height: 20pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">联系人</span></p></td><td style="border-top: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0pt 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle;"><p style="min-height: 20pt; line-height: 20pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">联系方式</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 28.35pt; text-align: center;"><td style="border-top: none; border-left: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: inherit; padding: 0pt 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle;"><p style="min-height: 20pt; line-height: 20pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">通信工程学院</span></p></td><td style="border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 0pt 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle;"><p style="min-height: 20pt; line-height: 20pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">顾老师 </span></p></td><td style="border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 0pt 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle;"><p style="min-height: 20pt; line-height: 20pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">81891677</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 28.35pt; text-align: center;"><td style="border-top: none; border-left: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: inherit; padding: 0pt 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle;"><p style="min-height: 20pt; line-height: 20pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">电子工程学院</span></p></td><td style="border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 0pt 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle;"><p style="min-height: 20pt; line-height: 20pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">王老师</span></p></td><td style="border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 0pt 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle;"><p style="min-height: 20pt; line-height: 20pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">81891663</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 28.35pt; text-align: center;"><td style="border-top: none; border-left: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: inherit; padding: 0pt 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle;"><p style="min-height: 20pt; line-height: 20pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">计算机科学与技术学院</span></p></td><td style="border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 0pt 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle;"><p style="min-height: 20pt; line-height: 20pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 1